{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1263086-fool-s-good-and-counterfeit-money-detectors","id":1263086,"title":"Fool's Good and counterfeit money detectors","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-10-27T10:24:11-07:00","id":1263086,"title":"Fool's Good and counterfeit money detectors","content":"This is an obvious question: in an age where such machines are everywhere, how can changelings still exploit this goblin contract?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-27T11:11:11-07:00","id":1263098,"title":"","content":"I dunno. I guess you use it in places like flea markets or small stores in towns you plan on leaving soon. Basically, places not likely to have those machines on hand (or places that will likely never see you again.<br /> <br /> I don't know the exact rules of the spell though.<br /> <br /> Or use it to pay someone, preferably someone who's not already a hardened criminal, to do something illegal. That way, they have reasons not to go to the police when they find out you tricked them. Be very careful with this application. Never use it to pay off people involved in gangs or such<br /> <br /> EDIT: ironically, it's probably a very bad idea to use it to pay for black market goods, as they are probably even more wary of counterfeiters than the average above-board store","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-28T12:44:24-07:00","id":1263231,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Raistlin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1263086-fool-s-good-and-counterfeit-money-detectors#post1263086\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is an obvious question: in an age where such machines are everywhere, how can changelings still exploit this goblin contract?</div> </div> </div> </div>When was the last time someone checked your cash outside of a bank?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-28T13:39:33-07:00","id":1263243,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1263086-fool-s-good-and-counterfeit-money-detectors?p=1263231#post1263231\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When was the last time someone checked your cash outside of a bank?</div> </div> </div> </div>Here in Spain, in every bar, gas station, shop, restaurant, etc.. and any place where money transactions take place regularly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-28T13:44:41-07:00","id":1263245,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Raistlin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1263086-fool-s-good-and-counterfeit-money-detectors?p=1263243#post1263243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Here in Spain, in every bar, gas station, shop, restaurant, etc.. and any place where money transactions take place regularly.</div> </div> </div> </div>That....doesn't happen here in the States, I can see the confusion.<br /> <br /> I'd argue that it's intention is to beat the minimum attention given in the area, so it should work there as well as it does here unless someone wanted to get REALLY into it, but that's me-powers should work most of the time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-28T14:37:11-07:00","id":1263257,"title":"","content":"In part, it\u2019s a compromise between the difficulty of the scenario versus how important it is to the game itself. Making everyone hard to reason with on account that in real life the players would have that kind of scrutiny makes for a very frustrating game, but making everyone so easy to reason with that the payers can use Insane Troll Logic to get through things trivializes the plot. It\u2019s the same here - for mundane scenarios that don\u2019t contribute to the plot, don\u2019t have as high a scrutiny on objects so the contract can be used for the players to at least survive or get food. For high import scenarios, make it hard for them to get the contract\u2019s gains to function, making them have to resort to other means to get what they want.<br /> <br /> Notably, don\u2019t make it <i>impossible</i> for the contract to work for the scenario, but don\u2019t make it easy either. This is meant to be for fun, collaborative storytelling, not a competition between ST and player on who can beat the other in a game of wiles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-28T14:56:32-07:00","id":1263261,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Raistlin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1263086-fool-s-good-and-counterfeit-money-detectors?p=1263243#post1263243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Here in Spain, in every bar, gas station, shop, restaurant, etc.. and any place where money transactions take place regularly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Huh. Yeah. That does not happen at all in the US. I'd say it passes muster for your average commercial machine, but nothing high end","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>",